WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,980
Speak well if you have something to say

2
00:00:01,980 --> 00:00:03,580
nothing to say

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:09,510
He is also the Duke of the country

4
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:16,460
Who takes action

5
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:18,260
Who will block him?

6
00:00:21,260 --> 00:01:02,400
Weren't you pretty good at gambling just now? You were so bold.

7
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,400
Dare to be our young master

8
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,520
Keep an eye on me and don't let him run away

9
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:08,720
Let our young master go

10
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:10,720
It's true to let people go

11
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,800
Loss of tables and chairs

12
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:12,760
Material and construction costs

13
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:14,040
Mental damages

14
00:01:14,040 --> 00:01:15,040
Honorary fee

15
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:16,240
Just let it go if you pay the compensation
